    "q": "<p>Based on the information provided, the total other comprehensive income (before tax) for the year ended 31 December 20X9 is:</p><ol class=\"answer-options\"><li><span class=\"choice-letter\">a)</span><span>£5,000</span></li><li><span class=\"choice-letter\">b)</span><span>£10,000</span></li><li><span class=\"choice-letter\">c)</span><span>£15,000</span></li><li><span class=\"choice-letter\">d)</span><span>£17,000</span></li></ol>",
    "a": "<p class=\"answer-key\">The correct answer is b.</p><p>The total other comprehensive income before tax is equal to the gain from the revaluation £15,000 minus the actuarial loss (£5,000). The gain on exchange differences is included within profit or loss.</p>",
